dpdk: request asynchronous CPUFreq boost from RX bursts

Opt-in single-policy controller; >=16 packets or consecutive >=8 within
1 ms requests a boost, held until 100 ms after the last qualifying burst.
Packet workers only publish timestamps and wake a nonblocking eventfd.

